%% PPTB Desktop App Threat Model
flowchart LR
    Maker(Maker / Tool Author)
    PPTB[PPTB Desktop Client - Electron]
    ToolHost[Secure Tool Host<br/>Isolated per-tool process]
    Github[(GitHub Releases<br/>Signed installers + auto-updates)]
    Registry[(Supabase Tool Registry<br/>Public catalog metadata only)]
    EntraID[(Microsoft Entra ID)]
    Dataverse[(Customer Dataverse / Power Platform)]

    Maker -->|Downloads signed installer| PPTB
    PPTB -->|Checks for updates / installs tools| Github
    PPTB -->|Fetches public tool catalog| Registry
    PPTB -->|Runs each tool isolated + per-tool CSP| ToolHost
    PPTB -->|MSAL OAuth flow| EntraID
    ToolHost -->|Executes maker actions via stored connection| Dataverse

